{"id":786536,"title":"12｜智能客服Agent：后端解析（Assistants API）","content":"本节课介绍如何搭建智能客服系统的后端服务。首先，通过提供的网址获取并运行已编写好的代码，使用fork and run功能复制代码并一键启动服务，无需自行配置服务器环境。在代码中需要修改几个关键部分：men.py文件中的大模型API密钥；function.py文件里的大模型API密钥、在线表单API密钥及表单地址；course.txt文件添加业务相关资料；调整assistant.json中的助理指令以适应特定需求。删除旧的assistant.json文件确保系统自动生成新的专属助理。完成上述步骤后点击run运行服务，检查是否生成新的assistant.json文件确认配置无误。右下角显示的服务端口号表明服务已成功运行。最后，将服务地址填入前端调用接口start和chat中即可完成整个流程。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392284,"user_name":"Geek_07ead6","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1714992,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"424137ADA9AA23","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eoREZlw6JWh1OXYvcKhOToBPCSqVr33Vhc0gmW9jNT3JHtW7NtaiaiaNJicjjxyVia7Oec3Qq1bzLGreQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1720495614,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142625,"content":"哈哈是的。这个问题如果解决不了可以扫码进微信群，一期讨论下解决方案。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1719027,"ctime":1720787298,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":392284,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"视频中用到的一些网站链接，需要科学上网才能访问吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/3a/f3/106ff941.jpg","nickname":"周文洋","note":"","ucode":"61D85493E804D1","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647927,"discussion_content":"哈哈是的。这个问题如果解决不了可以扫码进微信群，一期讨论下解决方案。","content_length":34,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1720787298,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1448773,"avatar":"","nickname":"莫子","note":"","ucode":"314703C16BCD88","race_medal":0,"user_type":1